The root cause is a brief outage of ts-train-service, which reached users through basic-service and the travel and route-plan services. I'm recording the findings below.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-train-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_failure",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'normal' p, MIN(time)::VARCHAR t0, MAX(time)::VARCHAR t1, COUNT(*) n FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-train-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', MIN(time)::VARCHAR, MAX(time)::VARCHAR, COUNT(*) FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-train-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server'",
          "claim": "ts-train-service server spans stop at 16:37:02 and resume at 16:37:49 in the abnormal window, a gap of about 47 seconds."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name pod, metric, MIN(value) mn, MAX(value) mx, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'ts-train-service%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "The ts-train-service pod shows container restarts of 1 during the abnormal window, unlike its steady normal state."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='SEVERE' AND message LIKE '%ts-train-service%Connection refused%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service logs SEVERE 'Connection refused' errors calling ts-train-service during the outage, 67 in total."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-train-service",
      "to": "ts-basic-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code code, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-basic-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND attr_http_response_status_code>=500 GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service server spans on /basic/travels and /basic/travel return HTTP 500 (67 total) while train-service is down."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-basic-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-service",
      "evidence": [
